  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test a baseline multimodal configuration to establish whether combining RNA and image data improves performance. This experiment tests the impact of multimodal fusion (concat) with simple encoders (pca_n2000 for RNA, resnet50 for image) and no aggregation, which directly addresses whether multimodal approaches are worth exploring. It is the best use of the first experiment as it reduces uncertainty about the most critical design choice: whether multimodal modeling provides value."
